---
export const prerender = true;

import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="MeshInfo Network"
  description="A centralized directory for MeshInfo instances — discover Meshtastic mesh networks near you."
>
  <!-- Hero -->
  <section class="relative overflow-hidden">
    <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-b from-brand-950/40 to-transparent pointer-events-none" />
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-4 py-24 sm:px-6 sm:py-32 lg:px-8">
      <div class="max-w-3xl">
        <div class="mb-4 inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-full border border-brand-800 bg-brand-950/50 px-3 py-1 text-xs font-medium text-brand-300">
          <span class="h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-brand-400"></span>
          Open network directory
        </div>
        <h1 class="text-4xl font-bold tracking-tight text-white sm:text-5xl lg:text-6xl">
          Discover
          <span class="text-brand-400"> MeshInfo</span>
          Instances
        </h1>
        <p class="mt-6 text-lg leading-8 text-gray-300">
          MeshInfo Network is the central directory for public
          <a href="https://github.com/MeshAddicts/meshinfo" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
            MeshInfo
          </a>
          deployments — a dashboard for Meshtastic mesh networks. Browse instances worldwide or register your own.
        </p>
        <div class="mt-8 flex flex-wrap gap-4">
          <a href="/instances" class="btn-primary">
            Browse Instances
            <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="h-4 w-4" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M13.5 4.5 21 12m0 0-7.5 7.5M21 12H3" />
            </svg>
          </a>
          <a
            href="https://github.com/MeshAddicts/meshinfo-network"
            target="_blank"
            rel="noopener noreferrer"
            class="btn-outline"
          >
            View on GitHub
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- What is MeshInfo? -->
  <section class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-4 py-16 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    <div class="grid gap-12 lg:grid-cols-2 lg:items-center">
      <div>
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white sm:text-3xl">What is MeshInfo?</h2>
        <p class="mt-4 text-gray-400 leading-7">
          <a href="https://github.com/MeshAddicts/meshinfo" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">MeshInfo</a>
          is an open-source web dashboard for <a href="https://meshtastic.org" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Meshtastic</a>
          mesh networks. It listens on a local network, collects node data, and presents a real-time map and statistics
          for everyone on the mesh.
        </p>
        <p class="mt-4 text-gray-400 leading-7">
          Anyone can run their own MeshInfo instance for their local or regional mesh.
          <strong class="text-gray-200">MeshInfo Network</strong> is where those instances register themselves so the
          community can discover them.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Stats blocks -->
      <div class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-4">
        <div class="card text-center">
          <div class="text-3xl font-bold text-brand-400">🌐</div>
          <div class="mt-2 text-sm font-medium text-gray-300">Global directory</div>
          <div class="mt-1 text-xs text-gray-500">Instances from around the world</div>
        </div>
        <div class="card text-center">
          <div class="text-3xl font-bold text-brand-400">🔒</div>
          <div class="mt-2 text-sm font-medium text-gray-300">Moderated listing</div>
          <div class="mt-1 text-xs text-gray-500">Manual approval before going public</div>
        </div>
        <div class="card text-center">
          <div class="text-3xl font-bold text-brand-400">📡</div>
          <div class="mt-2 text-sm font-medium text-gray-300">Live heartbeats</div>
          <div class="mt-1 text-xs text-gray-500">See when instances last checked in</div>
        </div>
        <div class="card text-center">
          <div class="text-3xl font-bold text-brand-400">🛡️</div>
          <div class="mt-2 text-sm font-medium text-gray-300">Privacy-first</div>
          <div class="mt-1 text-xs text-gray-500">No reporting by default</div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- How it works -->
  <section class="border-t border-surface-border">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-4 py-16 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white sm:text-3xl">How it works</h2>
      <p class="mt-3 text-gray-400">
        Getting your MeshInfo instance listed is a simple three-step process.
      </p>

      <ol class="mt-8 grid gap-6 sm:grid-cols-3">
        <li class="card relative">
          <div class="mb-3 flex h-8 w-8 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-brand-600 text-sm font-bold text-white">
            1
          </div>
          <h3 class="font-semibold text-white">Register</h3>
          <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-gray-400">
            Configure your MeshInfo instance with <code class="text-brand-300">reporting_mode = heartbeat</code> or
            <code class="text-brand-300">stats</code>. It will automatically register on startup and receive a secret token.
          </p>
        </li>
        <li class="card">
          <div class="mb-3 flex h-8 w-8 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-brand-600 text-sm font-bold text-white">
            2
          </div>
          <h3 class="font-semibold text-white">Await approval</h3>
          <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-gray-400">
            New registrations start as <strong class="text-gray-300">pending</strong> and are invisible publicly
            until a moderator reviews and approves the submission.
          </p>
        </li>
        <li class="card">
          <div class="mb-3 flex h-8 w-8 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-brand-600 text-sm font-bold text-white">
            3
          </div>
          <h3 class="font-semibold text-white">Stay listed</h3>
          <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-gray-400">
            Once approved, your instance appears in the public directory. Heartbeats keep the "last seen"
            timestamp fresh so users know it's active.
          </p>
        </li>
      </ol>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Privacy / reporting modes -->
  <section class="border-t border-surface-border">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-4 py-16 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white sm:text-3xl">Reporting modes</h2>
      <p class="mt-3 text-gray-400">
        MeshInfo instances control exactly how much they share with MeshInfo Network.
        The default is <strong class="text-gray-300">none</strong> — zero outbound traffic.
      </p>

      <div class="mt-8 grid gap-4 sm:grid-cols-3">
        <!-- none -->
        <div class="card border-l-2 border-l-gray-600">
          <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
            <span class="badge bg-gray-800 text-gray-400 border border-gray-700">none</span>
            <span class="text-xs text-gray-500">default</span>
          </div>
          <p class="mt-3 text-sm text-gray-400">
            No outbound calls of any kind. No registration, no heartbeat, no stats. The instance operates
            completely privately.
          </p>
        </div>

        <!-- heartbeat -->
        <div class="card border-l-2 border-l-brand-600">
          <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
            <span class="badge-indigo">heartbeat</span>
          </div>
          <p class="mt-3 text-sm text-gray-400">
            Registers on first startup and sends a lightweight "I'm alive" ping periodically. No detailed
            statistics or node data is transmitted.
          </p>
        </div>

        <!-- stats -->
        <div class="card border-l-2 border-l-emerald-600">
          <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
            <span class="badge-green">stats</span>
          </div>
          <p class="mt-3 text-sm text-gray-400">
            Includes all heartbeat behavior plus a coarse, privacy-conscious snapshot: approximate node count,
            broad geographic bounds, and software version.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- CTA -->
  <section class="border-t border-surface-border">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-4 py-16 text-center sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white sm:text-3xl">Ready to explore?</h2>
      <p class="mx-auto mt-4 max-w-xl text-gray-400">
        Browse the directory of approved MeshInfo instances. Each one represents a real community mesh
        network using Meshtastic hardware.
      </p>
      <div class="mt-8 flex justify-center">
        <a href="/instances" class="btn-primary text-base px-6 py-3">
          View all instances
          <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="h-5 w-5" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M13.5 4.5 21 12m0 0-7.5 7.5M21 12H3" />
          </svg>
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
